# lahn exercise
version 1
type neck
title Learn the neck, on bass
category Fretboard
author lahn
description A scale in one place on the bass's neck, played up and down, in thirds, in triads, or one note on every string. Change the key, the scale, the shape and the position as you go: your times are kept, and the neck shows which notes you find slowly.
key A
scale minor_pentatonic
fingering position
position 5
pattern straight
instrument bass
